  "loc": "Abstract; Section 1, p.1",
  "quote": "the random selection of political representatives",
  "note": "Paper is about sortition: randomly selecting a quota-satisfying panel from a volunteer pool. This is not aggregation of voters' inputs into a collective decision by voting. Pool members report features, not votes or preferences, and the paper is closer to a selection or lottery mechanism."
